{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "catatan-belajar-api-collection",
    "name": "Catatan Belajar API — Rafli Maulana RPL XI",
    "description": "Collection Postman untuk menguji API Catatan Belajar Pribadi menggunakan Laravel Sanctum.\n\nSemua request menyertakan:\n- Accept: application/json\n- Content-Type: application/json (untuk POST)\n\nToken disaramkan: salin token dari response login ke variable {{token}}.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL dasar API backend"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Token Sanctum — diisi otomatis setelah login. Token disaramkan (tidak ditampilkan di UI)."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Register Akun Baru",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "register"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pengguna A\",\n  \"email\": \"a@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Mendaftarkan akun baru. Tidak otomatis login, tidak mengembalikan token.\n\nCatatan: register dan login adalah langkah TERPISAH."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 201",
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Akun berhasil dibuat. Silakan login.\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Pengguna A\",\n    \"email\": \"a@test.com\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal — Email sudah terdaftar (422)",
          "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
          "code": 422,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"The email has already been taken.\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"email\": [\"The email has already been taken.\"]\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login (Dapatkan Token)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Samarkan token: simpan ke variabel collection, bukan ditampilkan langsung",
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.token) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
              "    console.log('Token tersimpan di variabel collection (tersaramkan).');",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"a@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Login dan dapatkan token Sanctum.\n\nToken otomatis disimpan ke variabel {{token}} lewat script. Token TIDAK perlu disalin manual.\n\nPerbedaan login vs register:\n- Register: buat akun, tidak ada token\n- Login: verifikasi identitas, kembalikan token untuk sesi berikutnya"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 200",
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Login berhasil.\",\n  \"token\": \"7|Ln3LR7gg1W52FxIUqN...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Pengguna A\",\n    \"email\": \"a@test.com\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal — Password salah (422)",
          "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
          "code": 422,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Email atau password salah.\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"email\": [\"Email atau password salah.\"]\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Profil Akun Aktif",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/profil", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "profil"] },
        "description": "Menampilkan data akun yang sedang login.\n\nMembutuhkan header: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 200",
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Pengguna A\",\n    \"email\": \"a@test.com\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal — Token tidak valid (401)",
          "status": "Unauthorized",
          "code": 401,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unauthenticated.\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Lihat Daftar Catatan",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/catatan", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "catatan"] },
        "description": "Menampilkan semua catatan milik akun yang login.\n\nIsolasi data: akun A hanya melihat catatan A, akun B hanya melihat catatan B."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 200",
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"judul\": \"Catatan Laravel Sanctum\",\n      \"isi\": \"Implementasi token-based auth berhasil.\",\n      \"dibuat\": \"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Tambah Catatan Baru",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/catatan", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "catatan"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"judul\": \"Rangkuman Laravel Sanctum\",\n  \"isi\": \"Sanctum menyediakan token-based auth yang ringan untuk SPA dan API mobile.\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Menyimpan catatan baru untuk akun yang login.\n\nPenting: user_id catatan TIDAK dikirim dari client. Server menentukan user_id dari token autentikasi — ini mencegah manipulasi data oleh client."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 201",
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Catatan berhasil disimpan.\",\n  \"catatan\": {\n    \"id\": 2,\n    \"judul\": \"Rangkuman Laravel Sanctum\",\n    \"isi\": \"Sanctum menyediakan token-based auth yang ringan...\",\n    \"dibuat\": \"2026-10-19T13:10:00.000000Z\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Logout (Cabut Token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "logout"] },
        "description": "Mencabut token aktif dari database.\n\nBukti logout berhasil:\n- Token dihapus dari tabel personal_access_tokens di database\n- Request berikutnya dengan token yang sama akan mendapat 401 Unauthorized"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sukses 200",
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Logout berhasil. Token telah dicabut.\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Bukti — Akses setelah logout (401)",
          "status": "Unauthorized",
          "code": 401,
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unauthenticated.\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
